{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan Abu Dawud","name_native":"Сунан Абу Дауд","section":{"5":"Prayer (Kitab Al-Salat): Voluntary Prayers"},"section_detail":{"5":{"hadithnumber_first":1250,"hadithnumber_last":1370,"arabicnumber_first":1250,"arabicnumber_last":1370,"name_native":"Книга молитвы (Намаз)"}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":1295,"arabicnumber":1295,"text":"Передаётся от Ибн ‘Умара, да будет доволен Аллах им и его отцом, что Пророк ﷺ сказал: «Ночная и дневная молитва по два рак‘ата»","grades":[{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Muhammad Muhyi Al-Din Abdul Hamid","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Shuaib Al Arnaut","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Hasan"}],"reference":{"book":5,"hadith":46}}]}